                <custos xml:id="m-8203cd77-096a-4f39-a105-c493a8ec136e" facs="#m-099f470c-6c65-4a42-aec8-c222af130fa7" pname="g" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-354074f4-ab30-4574-80d7-79003a5146d4">
              <lg xml:id="m-a5475377-598c-4fec-a67d-ecf5e839e85f">
                <l xml:id="m-938d2189-ca41-4f0f-abb4-8640c429480c" facs="#m-e58a03d9-534a-46da-a31e-8e447d65c5e4" label="ambiguous">coz</l><l xml:id="m-495c4dfe-906e-4699-a50e-b32346346b17" facs="#m-96a035c7-1da0-4210-9219-9dd6c4b8b277" label="text-like">Second Sunday of the Passion</l><l xml:id="m-bb3957f5-1a82-480c-b795-4c1f890006e2" facs="#m-8ff18af0-be0d-4550-a6a1-e7d481ddb31a" label="lyrics-like">sanctam civitátem, et apparué¬</l><l xml:id="m-afd617ae-b161-48d4-ba73-13a52cafa0ed" facs="#m-888014c3-7f10-414f-8b61-ce9fecb91f3f" label="ambiguous">terram usque ad horam nonam.</l><l xml:id="m-0c1e7ca2-68f5-4dbe-859e-b6db8fc25248" facs="#m-ae4626df-4a5c-4df3-b129-51699f4fc81d" label="lyrics-like">Et circa horam nonam clamávit</l><l xml:id="m-42e37a69-1369-4ba4-9a72-46a22247b3cf" facs="#m-89745cc8-40a1-4f53-b1cf-23314d8da207" label="lyrics-like">runt multis. Centúrio autem, et</l><l xml:id="m-d2f7a9a9-81b1-4238-8fae-9c3f78951cf0" facs="#m-971eae8c-7a50-4d11-bf72-88c3e3e98dc8" label="ambiguous">Jesus voce magna, dicens: 4</l><l xml:id="m-0e4ee320-21e4-4a11-82ee-698c7e478c80" facs="#m-49635ce4-a045-47df-89b7-592a1caa4610" label="lyrics-like">qui cum eo erant, custodiéntes</l><l xml:id="m-ca21b0df-8f60-44e9-8d5f-dacc460e546d" facs="#m-a7637e46-6ad2-4579-95a9-be116ef85b41" label="lyrics-like">Eli, Eli, lamma sabactháni?</l><l xml:id="m-12d44033-0a4c-4d3b-af38-19a07bd3fa1f" facs="#m-97520138-871a-42c5-99c3-9d661fe1f37b" label="lyrics-like">Jesum, viso terraemótu, et his,</l><l xml:id="m-4264e3fa-513a-4334-bde6-bb84f4eb7732" facs="#m-ddece253-1c1a-4d95-9bb1-78040b670202" label="lyrics-like">quae fiébant, timuérunt valde,</l><l xml:id="m-f1bc6c16-d4b0-46bc-8cbd-09eeae79e07d" facs="#m-ed6ae0fb-a121-46fe-ad02-9deae7dbbd0a" label="ambiguous">C. Hoc est: 4 Deus meus,</l><l xml:id="m-df9ff827-9870-4941-a1e9-7ff17f0cddc8" facs="#m-f53312ca-de35-48ff-b0b4-59d3c1da776a" label="lyrics-like">dicéntes: S. Vere Filius Dei</l><l xml:id="m-eaeb603c-4af8-430d-9d96-21cfdfb97b39" facs="#m-3739e53b-1501-4ab6-92be-067e09e9bcfc" label="ambiguous">Deus meus, ut quid dereliquisti</l><l xml:id="m-54fc4bd1-16a7-4129-919d-2552757fb137" facs="#m-273e0fd3-b285-40b9-a242-7503b325ca3a" label="ambiguous">erat iste. C. Erant autem ibi</l><l xml:id="m-76c5828f-1da4-42e2-86df-e50d85501157" facs="#m-76e3b499-9765-4013-be86-921fb701642b" label="ambiguous">me? C. Quidam autem illic</l><l xml:id="m-9a73bb48-3653-4900-bf58-2e39f9561a93" facs="#m-2fce1f5d-c8d4-4fc9-9c7e-9b14664aa922" label="lyrics-like">stantes, et audiéntes, dicébant:</l><l xml:id="m-567bf6ae-5c73-4a05-9022-5aadd1dc9af0" facs="#m-1103d3e2-36a9-4b63-ba87-cadb88baa881" label="ambiguous">mulieres multae a longe, quae</l><l xml:id="m-174f288c-ec59-41c7-96f0-7690e8e755eb" facs="#m-600749fc-9c9d-4901-a3bc-acd54f75a7f0" label="ambiguous">S. Elfam vocat iste. C. Et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-93f575d8-2190-44c9-9aa0-d11443c7e794" facs="#m-d243943f-d44e-400b-b045-c0e437170d0a" label="lyrics-like">secútae erant Jesum a Galilaéa,</l><l xml:id="m-b34ec721-635a-400c-895c-ea8b1d44f359" facs="#m-5a4f42db-54c3-45a2-9e15-d71114d324d9" label="lyrics-like">tinuo currens unus ex eis, accé¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd9e0aa3-185f-44b9-bee3-a86243395112" facs="#m-5019269c-3ef0-4ba4-880e-9062d20f9c39" label="lyrics-like">ministrántes ei: inter quas erat</l><l xml:id="m-98b97b5e-e930-485a-bfcf-3bb6292d14d9" facs="#m-82caff9c-08aa-4c6e-b035-a2d3d823c508" label="lyrics-like">Maria Magdaléne, et Maria Ja¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e5b697a-4de2-4b44-abbf-3c3161221f35" facs="#m-e40ff387-fd75-43d7-a200-2f0a05bee366" label="lyrics-like">ptam spóngiam implévit acéto,</l><l xml:id="m-47c68562-6c7f-44e3-9181-b7851528dda2" facs="#m-f54683e7-0b30-4853-ba26-38a6bd2bdc2f" label="lyrics-like">et impósuit arúndini, et dabat</l><l xml:id="m-8329bf43-d13f-487f-a0b9-32b98dd154a5" facs="#m-a34416ba-1dc8-4775-8322-01455fbb30f6" label="lyrics-like">cóbi, et Joseph mater, et mater</l><l xml:id="m-0904525e-d8bd-4a05-b879-efd7bf3cac5b" facs="#m-67c7a66d-5a62-48d7-8096-eb236c0e9b65" label="lyrics-like">el bibere. Céteri vero dicébant:</l><l xml:id="m-ddfd8630-cd71-483d-8ed7-1a1e38d41605" facs="#m-cb3951fa-6202-4c3e-b115-cb05003454a1" label="lyrics-like">nhórum Zebedaéi.</l><l xml:id="m-c9d0ead5-53dd-4f85-a2eb-45c6a4570a8b" facs="#m-7f2cd2c3-b6e9-44a6-8e88-8f3746db1050" label="lyrics-like">S. Sine, videámus an véniat</l><l xml:id="m-e67ea8fc-08d4-46b5-845d-8a8ff98dbb6d" facs="#m-4eac8d94-4616-48b7-8337-a54e9dd7adce" label="ambiguous">Cum autem sero factum esset,</l><l xml:id="m-1f473103-8939-4a8c-b2b2-5552a16cc314" facs="#m-ff7bfeae-3278-4f7a-8883-34da9ee31602" label="ambiguous">Elias liberans eum. C. Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-26f6c77b-8324-4d66-8d1e-2b435e651d0f" facs="#m-01ec745a-ae67-47de-9d72-35843d8e8e5c" label="ambiguous">venit quidam homo dives ab</l><l xml:id="m-feaa39b1-bb4b-4596-8e68-244c2dac03c7" facs="#m-9fc0db4b-bcf0-4647-a268-dcf212176306" label="lyrics-like">Arimathaéa, nómine Joseph, qui</l><l xml:id="m-ccfb462d-181e-45ce-a37f-374f0b9d5a95" facs="#m-120b2ab1-08e5-4907-9dd4-e16e11f3e388" label="ambiguous">autem iterum clamans voce ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-08fffad8-a01c-4aaa-b3fd-e25c360915b9" facs="#m-33428ab8-75f3-4821-8c17-5aebba4ca2c0" label="lyrics-like">gna, emísit spiritum. (Here a</l><l xml:id="m-60001476-0860-4cab-ac39-39df021c4765" facs="#m-ca3974ef-e722-46cc-9ece-b417734248b6" label="lyrics-like">et ipse discípulus erat Jesu.</l><l xml:id="m-1b64898f-7853-4a94-87ba-ea8abe3d1868" facs="#m-c49e1514-b18e-4c0b-bfe6-62eaadb89222" label="text-like">pause is made, and all kneel).</l><l xml:id="m-fb6e09de-7e59-4d40-8069-4fb6ce5eb1dc" facs="#m-cf44b3bd-922e-44e5-875d-d868cac5bdd7" label="lyrics-like">Hic accéssit ad Pilátum, et</l><l xml:id="m-1c31bc3c-b51c-47ca-ba52-b8bfeaba825b" facs="#m-f8af070a-2d4b-4893-905e-3ec4b0c3c187" label="lyrics-like">pétiit corpus Jesu. Tunc Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-5e1f03ba-97f9-421c-8f40-879270524592" facs="#m-9ac690d8-667c-4ed1-840b-16c79777f44a" label="ambiguous">Et ecce velum templi scissum</l><l xml:id="m-51fc1f75-e4fd-4f5a-8ff7-f19f9bf73e53" facs="#m-1ebafbec-5885-4637-8d2c-842476208e71" label="ambiguous">est in duas partes a summo</l><l xml:id="m-b6ea65d6-e5af-4e26-98df-9a66c82408c2" facs="#m-1a8ac502-0b46-4d89-a0b6-69cecd8e7934" label="lyrics-like">jussit reddi corpus. Et accépto</l><l xml:id="m-f1636256-39e3-4fb5-9dbf-61217accb1fe" facs="#m-9ab8d51b-0587-4fb5-b406-b5f1fb184db8" label="lyrics-like">córpore, Joseph invólvit illud</l><l xml:id="m-856b3858-1d4e-42ce-8f9d-3716cca898ce" facs="#m-c6c159b1-2bbb-4cf2-9e9c-a1fe10275ebe" label="lyrics-like">usque deórsum: et terra mota</l><l xml:id="m-2f9a40da-ce8f-48c8-ad3f-158802bb0dbe" facs="#m-2aecd8e4-f5af-40f5-be2d-9b5f3cf99085" label="ambiguous">est, et petrae scissae sunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-059622a3-f5af-466a-8bee-254c9758a9c4" facs="#m-7d69007c-1211-4725-9cf4-0f33e2aee9d0" label="lyrics-like">in sindone munda. Et pósuit</l><l xml:id="m-1acd269f-383a-451b-9c46-599348c49bf7" facs="#m-5fd3e86a-329f-49ca-8006-2314f32ad388" label="lyrics-like">monuménta apérta sunt: et</l><l xml:id="m-bc5e0de6-e184-49ba-b431-b3ae0ec1343b" facs="#m-33200e35-a424-43e9-bc96-f041069fa439" label="lyrics-like">illud in monuménto suo novo,</l><l xml:id="m-f1a1babf-d90d-4b2b-a26e-3d37e4d3252b" facs="#m-2e83d6cc-7abf-459f-99dd-1fb8cc7a664a" label="lyrics-like">multa córpora sanctórum, qui</l><l xml:id="m-877390f4-892f-4900-bfd5-fb6908f434dd" facs="#m-d3e0ca67-e3ce-447a-b600-ef783b9ee8a3" label="ambiguous">quod exciderat in petra. Et</l><l xml:id="m-b029ed28-3f15-45c8-92bc-c1f0f70e1153" facs="#m-883030aa-7546-4a03-b250-4731ec8777dc" label="lyrics-like">dormierant, surrexérunt. Et ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7dc72e6-bafe-4a38-a360-2f3339eaca0e" facs="#m-1618d37e-2ef4-40a2-a730-f8de81125257" label="lyrics-like">advólvit saxum magnum ad</l><l xml:id="m-d2dc9b71-dbe7-4db3-b651-321904b5598f" facs="#m-d950e7af-cfa7-4816-9fc2-7ea6f2d1e0d7" label="lyrics-like">eúntes de monuméntis post re- óstium monuménti, et ábiit.</l><l xml:id="m-df882c87-3bb1-49e5-9311-f1ffddc07bc8" facs="#m-f37fcf95-4333-4ce7-a08f-f08985fe2c35" label="lyrics-like">surrectiónem ejus, venérunt in</l><l xml:id="m-cb3bf15e-f1c4-407b-8fef-fe0217446804" facs="#m-aa493c37-59ac-48c3-ab22-c61642618c4b" label="text-like">The Credo is said.</l><l xml:id="m-9968ae65-85b6-4c69-bb4a-8e92db41e2b5" facs="#m-3d1df724-5bcd-45a8-a444-67c0edf02a83" label="text-like">After the singing or reading of the Passion the celebrant does not kiss the</l><l xml:id="m-cb66051c-622b-4ecb-87e1-636eeff4e11a" facs="#m-5b3a61d2-03a7-4b32-ae17-efcdfd5b7099" label="text-like">book, and is not censed; and ihe servers, in the simple rite, do not asmer</l><l xml:id="m-93a60fa9-1cac-4fc4-9103-08ef11e6ff4a" facs="#m-62cd731b-8dbf-40f7-b981-9fbe5bfcbab2" label="text-like">Laus tibi, Christe. The same rule is folloued on Tuesdav, Wednesday and</l><l xml:id="m-fb45841c-854b-4ec6-bedc-7209e9d2abf4" facs="#m-b2d68691-1f72-4a9d-9a08-01b316234284" label="text-like">Friday when the Passion is sung or read.</l><l xml:id="m-c93b6606-d43d-4038-80cf-e4a6e0959734" facs="#m-326615db-129f-445a-988f-3cf648263b3a" label="ambiguous">orert.!</l><l xml:id="m-13eaad46-b547-4b51-80bb-fe4b9b11d7f4" facs="#m-0cf12b0d-f5fe-44c9-a853-258bf8b68ee0" label="lyrics-like">M-propé-ri- um* exspectá-vit cor</l><l xml:id="m-fe10f64d-de81-4efc-a7fb-54c00fb89c6e" facs="#m-0f91d2a6-ebe0-4503-8734-df0c4f8553e4" label="lyrics-like">mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-aefb3fd0-1c12-4a09-a665-871fd9e49af8" facs="#m-56a9741a-3559-4df0-9da4-ee4bb642dbc8" label="lyrics-like">um, et mi- sé- ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-24ca78cc-8cf8-492a-ae9e-376a191812ee" facs="#m-45b9ebd9-d566-47c5-b914-1cc73071600c" label="lyrics-like">am: et sustí- nu- i qui</l><l xml:id="m-0fb5d50e-7147-4436-8ff0-d3b074ad69bb" facs="#m-55ad212f-696a-4151-9c60-6a2a6f947959" label="lyrics-like">si-mul contrista-ré¬ tur,</l><l xml:id="m-2fc102f2-d803-4faf-9563-bea74af25977" facs="#m-429340be-6122-4cf8-9ee2-00f6ea3e33a0" label="lyrics-like">et non fú¬</l><l xml:id="m-54b946a9-a9c6-47a1-87bb-944ac697999b" facs="#m-944c2fde-047a-44f3-968a-410bf8a620e8" label="ambiguous">it : con¬</l><l xml:id="m-07d83a0a-7ea6-4a31-8fa0-eb4cef0b99d2" facs="#m-73253071-7a9f-4edc-b7da-afe50a25a17b" label="ambiguous">vi,</l><l xml:id="m-cf6ce64d-3726-401f-84b0-270e33822327" facs="#m-d3a41311-803f-4ac2-a336-e576230f1739" label="lyrics-like">so-lán- tem me quae-sí¬</l><l xml:id="m-1be3aed5-2591-49fb-9010-412e00e4d163" facs="#m-3c0e7e91-b218-425e-bf46-ec59cb79f299" label="ambiguous">et non</l><l xml:id="m-c875bf82-917c-4636-a93f-7e5d33daebcb" facs="#m-798ea179-46a8-484b-9876-32db8dd9ebe2" label="ambiguous">in¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>